# Licenses of bundled mods

This modpack is a redistribution of open-source Fabric mods. Each mod retains
its original license.

| Mod | License | Author | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Fabric API | Apache-2.0 | FabricMC | https://github.com/FabricMC/fabric |
| Lithium | MIT | JellySquid | https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium-fabric |
| Cloth Config | Apache-2.0 | shedaniel | https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-config |
| Simple Voice Chat | MIT | henkelmax | https://github.com/henkelmax/simple-voice-chat |
| BlueMap | MIT | BlueMap contributors | https://github.com/BlueMap-Minecraft/BlueMap |

The `mc-mods-modpack` wrapper repo itself is licensed under MIT.
